:: Science Lesson Sleep
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<schooleffects>><<advancelesson>><<effects>>
시리스가 <<print either("해부학에 대해 강의하거나", "인간의 생식에 대한 비디오를 틀어주거나", "자연에 대해 열정적으로 이야기하거나", "학생 한 명을 교실 앞으로 불러내는")>> 동안 당신은 책상에 머리를 기댄다. 잠깐 눈을 감았다가 다시 뜬다. 깨어 있으려고 애쓰지만, 책상이 너무 편안하다.
<br><br>

<<tiredness `-Math.max(0, Math.min(20, _time_left)) / 5`>>

<<if $phase is 1>>
	<<lessonEnd "scienceClassroom" "sleep">>
<<else>>
	<<eventssciencesleep>>
<</if>>

:: Science Leighton Run
<<effects>>

You push your chair back and move with just a quick trip out. Your heart is hammering anyway.
<br><br>

<<if $athleticsSuccess>>
	<span class="green">You slip out clean.</span> Down the corridor, around the corner, and you're gone before anyone can call your name. 
	If the inspection is over, you know you'll have to go back. But for now... you're free.
	<br><br>

	<<set $schoolevent += 1>>
	<<set $schooleventtimer to random(7,22)>>
	<<endevent>>
	<<link [[다음|Science Lesson]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">"You."</span> Sirris' voice catches you mid-step.
	<br><br>
	You freeze with one foot still in the air, right at the edge of escape. The door is just starting to swing open, light spilling through the crack. 
	For a second, you actually consider making a run for it anyway. 
	<br><br>
	But you stand there too long.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Science Leighton Stay]]>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Science Leighton Stay
<<set $schoolevent += 1>><<set $schooleventtimer to random(7,22)>>
<<endevent>>
<<npc Sirris>><<person1>>"Everyone, please sit down!" Sirris says.<<endevent>><<npc Leighton>><<person1>> "I don't know why <<hes>> taken an interest, but <<he>> seemed satisfied last time."
<br><br>

문이 활짝 열리고 레이튼이 미소를 띤 채 들어선다. "고맙다, 시리스." <<he>>【이가】 말한다. "이제 내가 맡도록 하지."
<br><br>

"정말 제가 도울 일은 없을까요?" 시리스가 묻는다.
<br><br>

"I'll be fine." Leighton says it calmly, but <<nnpc_his "Leighton">> eyes linger on you a little too long for your liking and you brace yourself for a follow-up, a question, maybe even a comment. 
But instead, <<nnpc_he "Leighton">> just blinks, and continued, "You have a very cute class."
<br><br>

<<endevent>><<npc Sirris>><<person1>>
"O-okay." Sirris turns to the class as <<he>> leaves. "Be good, everyone," <<he>> whispers.
<br><br>

<<endevent>><<npc Leighton>><<person1>>

<<set _inspectRoll to random(1,100)>>
<<if _inspectRoll lte 50>>
	<<link [[다음|Penis Inspection]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<link [[다음|Pussy Inspection]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Science Leighton Run 2
<<effects>>
The moment Sirris says it, you're already moving. Slow. Casual. Like you're just heading to the toilet.
<br><br>

<<if $athleticsSuccess>>
	<span class="green">You get out.</span> Corridor, corner, then another until your footsteps fade into the school's noise. 
	You don't know how long you can stay away, but it won't be today inspection. And you going back to class when you know it is done already.
	<br><br>

	/* Success: skip the inspection but still resolve the event chain like vanilla */
	<<set $schoolevent to 1>>
	<<set $schooleventtimer to random(7,22)>>
	<<endevent>>
	<<link [[다음|Science Lesson]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

<<else>>
	<span class="red">"Where are you going?"</span> Sirris' voice snaps you in place.
	<br><br>
	You hesitate with body already leaning forward, weight shifting like you're one second from bolting. The door isn't far, maybe ten steps at most. You could make it. You <i>would</i> have made it. 
	But just as your muscles tense to move—
	<br><br>
	"Before we begin," Sirris cuts in, louder this time, "there's something important I need to say. I hope everyone's listening."
	<br><br>
	You exhale as you know your moment's gone. You turn back, dragging your feet a little as you head to your seat. No choice now.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Science Leighton Stay 2]]>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Science Leighton Stay 2
<<set $schoolevent to 1>><<set $schooleventtimer to random(7,22)>>

<<npc Sirris>><<person1>>"The headteacher's on the way and should be here any minute," Sirris says. "I hope it's not because I'm doing my job improperly."
<br><br>

<<endevent>><<npc Leighton>><<person1>>
"자네는 잘하고 있다." 레이튼이 들어서며 말한다. "나는 그저 정부에서 의무화한 건강 검진을 실시하는 것뿐이다."
<br><br>

"제가 도울 수 있습니다, 저에게—"
